{{PageBanner|godzillaen.png}}

A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular film franchise '''Godzilla''' (ゴジラ, ''Gojira'') was held from June 7th, 2021 to June 21st, 2021 for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and from August 16th, 2021 to August 30th, 2021 for all other versions. The collaboration includes exclusive stages going on during the collab period.

==Event Information==
The greatest threat to the Battle Cats yet... the colossal kaiju GODZILLA attacks the Cat Empire!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''August 16th (11:00am) through August 30th, 2021 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Godzilla stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Can you defeat the ultimate force of destruction?!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・The ultimate challenge... "Godzilla: Final Assault"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''An extreme difficulty stage!'''}}<br>
Visit Legend Stages/Event Stages to take on the {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Godzilla: Final Assault'''}} map and earn a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rare Ticket'''}} reward on stage clear!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・The inevitable showdown... "Godzilla vs Cats"!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From August 16th at 7:00pm'''}}, the beginner stage {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Godzilla vs Cats'''}} appears!<br>
Any stage from Easy to Insane gives a small chance to collect the limited Rare Cat [[Godzilla Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Godzilla Cat'''}}]], but clearing more difficult stages will give you a better chance to collect this reward!

※ Get a 100% chance to collect stage clear rewards when using the Treasure Radar item.<br>
※ After you have picked up Godzilla Cat, you can find it under Rare Cats in the Upgrade screen.

